# Text (part name Txt - `Text` is a muten primitive) - the one text atom, in a few roles. Everything that shows words
# in the kit is built from it, so a role changes in one place.
#   Txt(value: "Corte clásico", variant: "heading")
#   Txt(value: "{count} citas", variant: "muted")
# variant: body | title | heading | strong | label | muted | caption   (default: body)
# shadcn-for-muten · part · no deps · styled by kit.css (.cx-text).
part Txt(value: text, variant: text = "body") { Span "{$value}" class("cx-text") data(slot: "text", variant: $variant) }
